[User Controls / Presets] 
       │
       ▼
[RecursionEngine] ──(Generates Node Tree & Traversal Queue)──┐
       │                                                     │
       ▼ (Visual Coordinates)                                ▼ (Depth, Angle, Branch Index)
[CanvasRenderer (60fps)] ◄──(Sync Pulse / Active Node)──► [ProceduralAudioEngine (Web Audio API)]
                                                             │
                                                             ▼
                                                    [Master Gain Node]
